# Brand Colors

**Source of truth:** `packages/config/src/brand.ts` + `packages/config/src/colors.ts`  
**UI rule detail:** `.cursor/rules/oorjaman-ui.mdc`

## Wordmark palette (`brandColors`)

```ts
import { brandColors } from "@oorjaman/config";

brandColors.oorja;         // #549048 — “Oorja”
brandColors.man;           // #1C4276 — “Man” (softened navy, not near-black)
brandColors.tagline;       // #9B9B9B — tagline + muted labels
brandColors.gradientGreen; // #549048 — loading / accent start
brandColors.gradientBlue;  // #1C4276 — loading / accent end
```

## App UI palette (`colors`)

```ts
import { colors } from "@oorjaman/config";

colors.primary;            // #1f8660 — CTAs
colors.foreground;           // #0f2938 — structure text
colors.mutedForeground;    // #516a7b — secondary text
colors.background;         // #f6faf9 — canvas
```

Do **not** use deprecated values: `#6FB53E`, `#0F4D92`, `#0B1C3A`, `#082B5B`.

